{"ID":"20240515131355-ih0snbv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131355-ih0snbv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131355-ih0snbv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142259-6wj1465\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142259-6wj1465\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142259-6wj1465\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:365,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:365\u0026#125;","title":"088","type":"doc","updated":"20240515181343"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515142259-6wj1465","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 689px;","id":"20240515142259-6wj1465","updated":"20240515181343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MK"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"～50，微胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/29"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎臟病復診。仍有一付未煮。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本周服前方1小時後出現胸悶"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡：仍不好，仍有盗汗皮癢，仍不易入眠"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：正常，每日行，但不多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：淡黃，無泡沫，尿意強，小便力量大"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汗：有汗出了→心臟功能在恢復中"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無力、緩"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後布舌苔白濕厚，前部淡粉紅，有牙痕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 : "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右瞳孔對光反應好，左瞳孔對光反應較慢→左腎功能不如右腎"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"進步許多"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同8/7處方 再2付，煮法一樣，但是服用的量減半，早晚餐前各服半碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/7處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子三錢，乾薑二錢，炙甘草三錢，澤瀉六錢，豬苓三錢，茯苓五錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸三錢，桂枝五錢，白朮五錢，半夏三錢，吳茱萸二錢，側柏葉四錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子四錢，生薑二錢，川芎三錢，丹皮三錢，柴胡三錢，鬱金三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方中有生附子、炮附子，病人本周在服藥時會出現胸悶的現象，說明她對附子的需求量降低，也就是說裡寒減少許多，病情在好轉中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}